# Keep line endings stable across platforms: the working tree gets CRLF on
# Windows, the repository stores LF. Without this, `git status` reports every
# edited file as modified after a checkout with a different core.autocrlf, and
# a diff of an untouched file is noise.
* text=auto

*.R linguist-language=R
*.rda linguist-language=R
*.rds linguist-language=R
